config WT_BSP_BOARD_HAS_CAMERA
    bool

config WT_BSP_ENABLE_CAMERA
    bool "Enable local JPEG capture alongside USB UVC"
    depends on WT_BSP_BOARD_HAS_CAMERA && WT_BSP_ENABLE_USB_DEVICE_UVC
    default y
    help
        Expose board-owned JPEG frames to an application while the USB host
        is not using the camera. Camera hardware is prepared explicitly by
        the application, allowing the RGB and USB interfaces to report a
        missing camera without tearing down the rest of the board.
